[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C18_HEI_SHA_CHRONICLES]
“Black Sand Chronicle”

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C18_HEI_SHA_CHRONICLES_DESC]
An ancient book, which seems to come from the era shortly after the war between the Peaks of Peril Kirins and Nan Du Niriks, recording the lives of a group of Kirins who survived on the battlefield. Although it is called the “Chronicle”, the book seems to contain many mythical elements.

